{"title":"Conference Report and Intelligence Briefing: ACAH/ACCS/ACSS2025","link":"https://iafor.org/conference-report-and-intelligence-briefing-acah-accs-acss2025/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=conference-report-and-intelligence-briefing-acah-accs-acss2025","date":1754366271000,"content":"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ACAH2025-Report-Group-1500-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"ACAH/ACCS/ACSS2025 Conference Report\" srcset=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ACAH2025-Report-Group-1500-150x150.jpg 150w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ACAH2025-Report-Group-1500-600x600.jpg 600w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ACAH2025-Report-Group-1500-100x100.jpg 100w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ACAH2025-Report-Group-1500-50x50.jpg 50w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ACAH2025-Report-Group-1500-300x300.jpg 300w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ACAH2025-Report-Group-1500-32x32.jpg 32w\" />IAFOR held its 2025 Spring Conference Series from May 11 to 16 in Tokyo, Japan. This conference series brought together 586 delegates representing 343 institutions from 52 countries to The 16th Asian Conference on Arts and Humanities (ACAH2025), The 15th Asian Conference on Cultural Studies (ACCS2025), and The 16th Asian Conference on Social Sciences (ACSS2025). <a href=\"https://iafor.org/conference-report-and-intelligence-briefing-acah-accs-acss2025/\">...</a>\n<p><a href=\"https://iafor.org/conference-report-and-intelligence-briefing-acah-accs-acss2025/\">Source</a></p>","author":"IAFOR","siteTitle":"The International Academic Forum (IAFOR)","siteHash":"db6175d8277e1d8dd86d5cc607b1dd9335cce255aa7e00b46d0931f23a0d47f6","entryHash":"2b2191cd71821563ba854d73939b1664add5073c1f844810ca6d95e06a175319","category":"Interdisciplinary"}